{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "MEGACHESS",
    "steam_appid": 3645080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/7a34ab819c13345b4e6f77a3c40f2599.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/7a34ab819c13345b4e6f77a3c40f2599.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEGACHESS</strong> is a tactical roguelite where you explore an underground dungeon with your army of chess pieces. Using their special effects and by merging them into <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong>, battle hordes of enemies and bosses to reach the <i>Throne Room. </i>Can you face the <strong>MEGA-KING</strong><i> </i>and free your kind from their grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/b1a904223fc1781d4336752a4805a47e.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/b1a904223fc1781d4336752a4805a47e.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4fbd32a84a747ec3476133aec9db37c7.avif?t=1748448622\" width=254 height=71 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse the dungeon: </strong>Build districts of the dungeon as you explore it. Draft uncharted passages filled with fights, treasures, bosses and altars that permanently upgrade your army. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through fights without losing units</strong>: Tactical yet fast-paced, every ally or enemy has a single life point. Carefully choose and place your pieces, unleash devastating combos and eliminate all enemy pieces in one turn.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush enemies with MEGA-PIECES</strong>: Merge similar pieces to form massive <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong> that crush multiple enemies at once.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade the dungeon</strong>: Progress through <strong>3 difficulty Tiers</strong>, each increasing the variety of encounters, districts, and tools at your disposal, until you reach the <strong>MEGA-KING</strong>\u2019s <i>Throne Room.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4ad89ae0a0c7962e6868be9160b0b327.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4ad89ae0a0c7962e6868be9160b0b327.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/7a34ab819c13345b4e6f77a3c40f2599.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/7a34ab819c13345b4e6f77a3c40f2599.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEGACHESS</strong> is a tactical roguelite where you explore an underground dungeon with your army of chess pieces. Using their special effects and by merging them into <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong>, battle hordes of enemies and bosses to reach the <i>Throne Room. </i>Can you face the <strong>MEGA-KING</strong><i> </i>and free your kind from their grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/b1a904223fc1781d4336752a4805a47e.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/b1a904223fc1781d4336752a4805a47e.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4fbd32a84a747ec3476133aec9db37c7.avif?t=1748448622\" width=254 height=71 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse the dungeon: </strong>Build districts of the dungeon as you explore it. Draft uncharted passages filled with fights, treasures, bosses and altars that permanently upgrade your army. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through fights without losing units</strong>: Tactical yet fast-paced, every ally or enemy has a single life point. Carefully choose and place your pieces, unleash devastating combos and eliminate all enemy pieces in one turn.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush enemies with MEGA-PIECES</strong>: Merge similar pieces to form massive <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong> that crush multiple enemies at once.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade the dungeon</strong>: Progress through <strong>3 difficulty Tiers</strong>, each increasing the variety of encounters, districts, and tools at your disposal, until you reach the <strong>MEGA-KING</strong>\u2019s <i>Throne Room.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4ad89ae0a0c7962e6868be9160b0b327.poster.avif?t=1748448622\" width=620 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/4ad89ae0a0c7962e6868be9160b0b327.webm?t=1748448622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "MEGACHESS is a roguelite dungeon crawler with chess elements. Blast through high-paced tactical battles, adapt your army against outnumbering foes, craft and combine your units to form MEGA-PIECES and obliterate the bosses.",
